  "releaseNotes": "LuciferServer:\n      - LuciferServer: Integrated built-in System Management Dashboard directly into the assembly.\n      - Web Infrastructure: Added AddEmbeddedStaticContent to serve UI assets from Embedded Resources with zero-copy.\n      - Architecture Refactor: Moved Static Content logic from Session to Server Protocol to reduce per-session overhead.\n      - Performance: Optimized Request Mapping using Utf8Map for O(1) static file lookup.\n      - Maintenance: Updated access modifiers to internal for better encapsulation and maintainability.",
